engine/godot/pull/105450.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-20T23:15:21Z"},"body":"It looks like `ClassDB::class_get_default_property_value` only works for properties defined in the specified class. When implementing the upgrading tool for C# we replace Nodes and Resources with `MissingNode` and `MissingResource`, and saving them adds a lot of unwanted noise.\r\n\r\nThis PR tries to avoid that noise by looking at their base type `Node` and `Resource` instead but it's more like a hack than a proper solution. Alternatively, we could modify `ClassDB::class_get_default_property_value` to iterate the class hierarchy instead, but I don't know what consequences a change like that could have throughout the engine.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105450/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}